  "shortDescription": "Railway Recruitment Board has released the RRB JE CEN 05/2025 CBT-II Result 2026 for 2569 posts. Candidates can check regional result PDFs, cutoff, score card and official notices.",
  "content": "<p><strong>Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</strong> has released the <strong>RRB Junior Engineer (JE) CEN 05/2025 CBT-II Result 2026</strong> for <strong>2569 posts</strong>.</p><p>The CBT-II examination was held on <strong>02 July 2026</strong> and the CBT-II result update is dated <strong>16/09/2026</strong>. Candidates can download the result, regional cutoff and score card using the official links below.</p><h2>Important Dates</h2><ul><li>Application Begin: <strong>31/10/2025</strong></li><li>Last Date for Apply Online: <strong>10/12/2025</strong></li><li>Form Correction: <strong>13 to 22 December 2025</strong></li><li>CBT-I Exam Date: <strong>19-20 February and 25 February 2026</strong></li><li>CBT-I Answer Key: <strong>05/03/2026</strong></li><li>CBT-I Result: <strong>13/05/2026</strong></li><li>CBT-II Exam Date: <strong>02/07/2026</strong></li><li>CBT-II Answer Key: <strong>10/07/2026</strong></li><li>CBT-II Result: <strong>16/09/2026</strong></li></ul><h2>Application Fee</h2><ul><li>General / OBC / EWS: <strong>₹500</strong></li><li>SC / ST / PH: <strong>₹250</strong></li><li>All category female: <strong>₹250</strong></li></ul><p>Refund is made after appearing in Stage-I examination according to the applicable category.</p><h2>Vacancy Details</h2><ul><li><strong>Post:</strong> RRB Junior Engineer</li><li><strong>Total:</strong> 2569 posts</li><li><strong>Category distribution:</strong> General 1090, EWS 244, OBC 615, SC 541, ST 79</li></ul><p>Download the result and cutoff for your RRB region. Candidates should use the official score card login for individual marks.</p>",
